    <Member Name="referenceVelocity" Datatype="LReal">
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="de-DE">[TO unit] Reference velocity which can be used for an external axis control (sectionalDriveConfig.axisCtrl = FALSE). Represents the maximum axis velocity  at maximum line velocity</MultiLanguageText>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">[TO unit] Reference velocity which can be used for an external axis control (sectionalDriveConfig.axisCtrl = FALSE). Represents the maximum axis velocity  at maximum line velocity</MultiLanguageText>
      </Comment>
    </Member>
    <Member Name="diameterFactor" Datatype="LReal">
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="de-DE">[%] Scaling factor for parameter "sectionalDriveDiag.referenceVelocity" which can be used for an external axis control (sectionalDriveConfig.axisCtrl = FALSE). Velocity setpoint = referenceVelocity * diameterFactor/100.0. The diameterFactor can directly be copied to the velocityOverride parameter of the TO (&lt;TO&gt;.Override.Velocity) </MultiLanguageText>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">[%] Scaling factor for parameter "sectionalDriveDiag.referenceVelocity" which can be used for an external axis control (sectionalDriveConfig.axisCtrl = FALSE). Velocity setpoint = referenceVelocity * diameterFactor/100.0. The diameterFactor can directly be copied to the velocityOverride parameter of the TO (&lt;TO&gt;.Override.Velocity) </MultiLanguageText>
      </Comment>
    </Member>
